## 📌 Project Overview
AI Error Tutor is an intelligent, pedagogical Python compiler and diagnostic tutor that:
1. Employs a **4-Pass Multi-Error Self-Healing Repair Engine** (`analyze_all`) with resilient dynamic execution and cascade error tracking.
2. Utilizes a **Multi-Agent Compiler System (MACS)** with 7 specialized agents communicating via a blackboard architecture.
3. Operates a **3-Tier Hybrid AI Provider Chain** (Gemini API cloud primary via `google-genai` SDK, offline Ollama `qwen2.5-coder:3b`, and deterministic AST rule-based engine).
4. Enforces an **Agentic AI (AAI) Security Guard & Attack Lab** mitigating the OWASP Top 10 (2025/2021) and OWASP Top 10 for LLMs.
5. Features a **Two-Pane CodeChef-style IDE** with dual pedagogical modes (Direct Solution vs Socratic Progressive Clues) and 1-click verified fix application.

